WEBVTT

00:31.550 --> 00:35.100
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.120 --> 00:38.500
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.770 --> 00:44.740
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.900 --> 00:49.530
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.550 --> 00:53.060
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.080 --> 00:56.570
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.590 --> 01:00.100
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.120 --> 01:06.180
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.440 --> 01:23.720
Si Jin

01:23.740 --> 01:27.740
Episode 1

01:27.760 --> 01:29.670
(Zhengyang Gate)
(In the 10th year of Qingyan, )

01:29.690 --> 01:32.120
(the Grand Princess dominated the court.)

01:32.140 --> 01:34.550
(When her tyranny shook the state, )

01:34.570 --> 01:37.090
(Tiande Hall)
(Nanwu invaded Dazhou.)

01:37.090 --> 01:39.650
(Chaos arose.)

01:40.610 --> 01:42.620
I was born

01:43.250 --> 01:45.060
and raised in Dazhou,

01:45.850 --> 01:47.050
but you and your daughter

01:47.050 --> 01:49.100
mean to kill me for good,

01:49.250 --> 01:52.180
leaving me no chance of survival.

02:18.970 --> 02:20.860
(I never thought)

02:21.100 --> 02:23.420
(I'd be killed by you.)

02:29.440 --> 02:32.960
(Yu)

02:49.570 --> 02:51.580
(If I had a second chance, )

02:51.730 --> 02:54.210
(would things end up differently?)

02:55.280 --> 02:59.600
(Jiang Si, Earl Dongping's Daughter)

03:54.240 --> 04:00.360
(Friends Gather Together)

04:04.440 --> 04:08.200
(Ling'an)

04:24.370 --> 04:25.730
You're awake, Miss.

04:26.050 --> 04:27.410
Have some water

04:27.540 --> 04:28.900
and eat something.

04:32.520 --> 04:36.160
(Yu Qi, Chief of Chiyu Cavalry)

04:47.700 --> 04:49.120
Are you feeling better?

04:55.370 --> 04:56.890
Why did you kill me?

04:58.410 --> 04:59.260
Why would I kill you?

04:59.260 --> 05:00.680
Why did I save your life?

05:00.700 --> 05:02.210
Hey, Miss, why did you slap him?

05:02.210 --> 05:03.640
(Long Dan)
Last night, you fell into

05:03.640 --> 05:05.040
(Yu Qi's Guard)
the Jinshui River!

05:05.040 --> 05:06.490
Chief saved your life!

05:06.540 --> 05:08.100
He didn't kill you.

05:08.140 --> 05:09.660
Jinshui River?

05:12.850 --> 05:13.740
Chief, maybe

05:13.760 --> 05:14.610
her brain was damaged

05:14.610 --> 05:16.450
when she almost drowned.

05:16.490 --> 05:18.180
Don't mind her attitude.

05:18.260 --> 05:20.330
(How did I fall into that river?)

05:20.700 --> 05:22.060
(Could it be...?)

05:23.260 --> 05:24.620
What time is it now?

05:24.640 --> 05:26.240
A little past the Shen hour.

05:26.260 --> 05:27.810
You rested here for almost a day.

05:27.810 --> 05:28.680
Which year is it?

05:28.700 --> 05:29.540
You slapped Chief.

05:29.550 --> 05:30.730
Shouldn't you apologize first?

05:30.730 --> 05:32.150
Answer my question!

05:32.170 --> 05:33.780
The 23rd year of Jingming.

05:36.540 --> 05:38.490
The 23rd year of Jingming...

05:40.140 --> 05:41.540
How come?

05:42.260 --> 05:44.220
(This is 10 years ago!)

05:44.370 --> 05:45.730
Drowned...

05:51.900 --> 05:53.490
Ji Chongyi...

05:54.320 --> 05:56.440
(Jinshui River)

06:23.580 --> 06:24.940
Here you go.

06:45.660 --> 06:47.020
Young Master Ji!

06:48.700 --> 06:50.180
Miss Si!

06:51.100 --> 06:52.460
Leave now.

06:55.140 --> 06:56.150
Miss Si...

06:56.170 --> 06:57.440
Young Master Ji,

06:57.460 --> 06:59.080
we've engaged.

06:59.100 --> 07:00.560
How could you cheat on me?

07:00.580 --> 07:01.660
It's not what it looks like.

07:01.660 --> 07:03.400
Listen to me, I can explain, alright?

07:03.420 --> 07:05.050
- Miss Si.
- You're still protecting her!

07:05.050 --> 07:06.320
Jiang Si, I can explain!

07:06.340 --> 07:07.320
Jiang Si!

07:07.340 --> 07:08.700
Jiang Si!

07:10.370 --> 07:11.440
(That year, )

07:11.460 --> 07:13.810
(Ji Chongyi pushed me into that river.)

07:14.340 --> 07:15.890
(If this is 10 years ago, )

07:16.290 --> 07:17.810
(then my family members)

07:18.020 --> 07:19.810
(are still alive.)

07:24.930 --> 07:26.290
Miss,

07:26.540 --> 07:28.030
do you still feel unwell?

07:28.050 --> 07:29.780
Do you need to see a physician?

07:31.410 --> 07:32.770
No, thanks.

07:33.410 --> 07:35.300
I was in a trance. I'm fine.

07:39.340 --> 07:40.700
Thanks for your help.

07:40.970 --> 07:41.970
I need to go home.

07:41.970 --> 07:43.140
My family must be worried.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.440
Good day.

07:44.460 --> 07:45.790
I'll walk you home.

07:45.810 --> 07:47.150
No need.

07:47.170 --> 07:48.320
My family is conservative.

07:48.340 --> 07:49.700
It's inconvenient.

07:52.100 --> 07:53.390
You were soaking wet.

07:53.410 --> 07:54.770
Don't catch a cold.

07:56.660 --> 07:57.710
I'm Yu Qi.

07:57.730 --> 07:59.370
May I know your name?

08:06.780 --> 08:08.180
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

08:47.860 --> 08:49.150
Chief,

08:49.170 --> 08:50.810
why did you bring her back?

08:53.140 --> 08:54.900
To let her know me.

08:55.660 --> 08:57.160
She fell into the water!

09:25.380 --> 09:27.570
I saw Nanwu's Flame Totem on her neck.

09:27.740 --> 09:28.720
Perhaps

09:28.740 --> 09:30.660
she's their spy.

09:30.860 --> 09:32.660
If so, why did you let her go?

09:34.740 --> 09:36.120
Following that fish,

09:36.140 --> 09:37.970
we'll find the shoal.

09:44.260 --> 09:46.240
Freshly baked Milk Cakes!

09:46.260 --> 09:47.660
Take a look!

09:49.500 --> 09:51.880
Sister, Milk Cakes are so good!

09:51.900 --> 09:53.780
Let's buy some to eat at night.

10:03.450 --> 10:05.330
Take a look, sir.

10:06.780 --> 10:08.610
Cheap and tasty!

10:09.660 --> 10:10.720
Take a look.

10:10.740 --> 10:12.380
Freshly baked Milk Cakes.

10:12.380 --> 10:13.930
Would you like some, Miss?

10:18.090 --> 10:19.450
Sister,

10:19.660 --> 10:20.790
help.

10:20.810 --> 10:22.170
Brother!

10:25.860 --> 10:26.760
Go!

10:26.780 --> 10:28.140
Move!

10:37.260 --> 10:38.620
Si,

10:38.780 --> 10:39.760
turn around.

10:39.780 --> 10:41.310
Go home!

10:41.330 --> 10:43.180
Go home!

10:46.860 --> 10:48.610
Move! Keep going!

10:51.260 --> 10:52.620
Father!

10:57.160 --> 11:02.120
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Funeral)

11:05.320 --> 11:06.480
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

11:06.480 --> 11:08.560
(Funeral)

11:18.380 --> 11:20.000
(Did Father and Brother)

11:20.020 --> 11:22.300
(fail to survive as last time?)

11:27.660 --> 11:29.120
The body was retrieved just now.

11:29.140 --> 11:30.760
Did he drown?

11:30.780 --> 11:32.610
Look at the cut on his face.

11:34.660 --> 11:35.570
Right.

11:35.570 --> 11:36.570
His family must be rich.

11:36.570 --> 11:37.930
His clothes are nice.

11:42.900 --> 11:44.330
Young Master Zhan!

11:47.090 --> 11:49.060
Zhan!

11:51.020 --> 11:53.540
Zhan!

11:57.380 --> 12:01.670
Observer Jiang Ancheng
of the Directorate of Astronomy

12:01.690 --> 12:03.480
(Execution)
altered the horoscope.

12:03.500 --> 12:05.260
He shall be executed

12:07.170 --> 12:09.380
for such a capital crime!

12:09.380 --> 12:11.360
(Execution)

12:11.380 --> 12:12.740
Si,

12:13.260 --> 12:16.780
go home!

12:18.020 --> 12:19.380
(I'm back.)

12:20.140 --> 12:21.690
(Are you two alright?)

12:26.570 --> 12:28.970
There you are, Miss Si. This is great!

12:30.540 --> 12:31.740
Miss... Miss Si!

12:31.740 --> 12:32.660
- Miss Si!
- Go!

12:32.660 --> 12:34.090
Miss Si is back. Go!

12:35.660 --> 12:37.690
Miss Si, you're back.

12:37.690 --> 12:39.000
Thank goodness!

12:39.020 --> 12:41.500
Miss Si, didn't you...?

12:44.290 --> 12:45.690
Miss Si,

12:45.930 --> 12:47.290
you're back!

12:50.050 --> 12:51.780
Ms. Xiao asked us to put together

12:51.780 --> 12:53.210
this funeral.

12:54.660 --> 12:55.550
I see.

12:55.570 --> 12:56.970
You may leave.

13:09.840 --> 13:14.280
(Tablet of Jiang Si
of Earl Dongping's Mansion)

13:17.760 --> 13:21.760
(Tablet of Jiang Si
of Earl Dongping's Mansion)

13:21.760 --> 13:22.960
(They're fine.)

13:22.980 --> 13:24.570
(It's my tablet.)

13:25.500 --> 13:26.690
How useless!

13:26.690 --> 13:28.500
Didn't I pay the carpenter two more taels

13:28.500 --> 13:29.810
of silver to make the coffin

13:29.810 --> 13:31.030
overnight?

13:31.050 --> 13:32.760
Look what time it is now!

13:32.780 --> 13:33.760
Where's the coffin?

13:33.780 --> 13:35.570
My Lady, I heard that Young Master Ji

13:35.570 --> 13:37.310
pushed Miss Si into the water.

13:37.330 --> 13:38.360
What?

13:38.380 --> 13:39.450
Poor Miss Si.

13:39.450 --> 13:41.020
She was so unfortunate.

13:45.500 --> 13:47.500
Duke An's heir

13:47.500 --> 13:49.780
pushed his fiancée

13:49.780 --> 13:51.450
into the water.

13:53.410 --> 13:55.720
Even the wildest rumor wouldn't say so.

13:55.740 --> 13:57.960
Bring some food to the riverside.

13:57.980 --> 14:00.450
The First Branch's servants are there

14:00.450 --> 14:03.150
looking for her body.

14:03.170 --> 14:05.520
Also, tell them to take a break

14:05.540 --> 14:07.150
when they're tired.

14:07.170 --> 14:09.540
They'll find the body sooner or later.

14:10.980 --> 14:12.810
Is the troupe all set?

14:13.140 --> 14:14.500
Aunt Xiao.

14:16.160 --> 14:17.960
(Mrs. Li, Stewardess of the Second Branch)

14:17.980 --> 14:19.560
Miss... Miss Si!

14:19.560 --> 14:21.160
(Wife of the Second Branch)
My Lady!

14:21.160 --> 14:22.520
(Ms. Xiao)
My Lady!

14:24.980 --> 14:26.240
My goodness!

14:26.260 --> 14:27.620
She... You...

14:28.620 --> 14:29.880
What...?

14:29.900 --> 14:32.360
You're back, Miss Si.

14:32.380 --> 14:33.810
Yes, I am.

14:33.900 --> 14:35.570
You must be disappointed.

14:49.660 --> 14:51.090
It really is you, Si.

14:51.090 --> 14:52.380
We thought

14:52.380 --> 14:54.300
something bad happened to you.

14:54.690 --> 14:56.090
Your father and the servants

14:56.090 --> 14:57.970
are looking for you by the river.

14:58.050 --> 14:59.640
Never mind. Forget that.

14:59.660 --> 15:01.690
I couldn't sleep at all last night.

15:01.690 --> 15:02.980
Were you too excited

15:02.980 --> 15:04.810
to sleep?

15:08.900 --> 15:10.090
Good heavens!

15:10.090 --> 15:12.170
I can't be wronged like that.

15:12.170 --> 15:13.570
Should the sky fall,

15:13.570 --> 15:14.980
someone has to hold it.

15:14.980 --> 15:17.520
Your father is a useless alcoholic.

15:17.540 --> 15:19.910
Your brother is a good-for-nothing.

15:19.930 --> 15:21.930
Your mother died when giving birth to you.

15:21.930 --> 15:23.450
Things like funerals can't go wrong.

15:23.450 --> 15:24.540
Only I can prepare it

15:24.540 --> 15:26.210
for you.

15:28.090 --> 15:30.330
He's a freeloader and loser

15:30.740 --> 15:32.050
while you're a jinx who caused

15:32.050 --> 15:33.120
your mother's death.

15:33.140 --> 15:35.050
Motherless children like you

15:35.050 --> 15:36.500
are indeed ill-mannered

15:36.500 --> 15:37.930
and uncultured!

15:39.890 --> 15:41.050
- Are you alright?
- My Lady.

15:41.050 --> 15:42.410
I'm fine.

15:44.780 --> 15:46.000
The money wasn't stolen.

15:46.020 --> 15:48.070
The accountant made a mistake.

15:48.090 --> 15:49.290
Still, I need to

15:49.290 --> 15:50.520
teach them a lesson

15:50.540 --> 15:52.380
for offending seniors.

15:52.410 --> 15:54.060
They'll kneel there.

15:54.090 --> 15:55.450
They can't get up.

15:58.450 --> 15:59.810
My Lady!

16:01.140 --> 16:02.270
Aunt Xiao,

16:02.290 --> 16:04.060
there was a bug on your face.

16:04.140 --> 16:05.570
Did it bite you?

16:07.330 --> 16:08.690
I...

16:09.500 --> 16:11.270
Use the other hand next time.

16:11.290 --> 16:12.650
I...

16:14.290 --> 16:15.840
The elegiac couplets,

16:15.860 --> 16:17.070
the chosen tunes,

16:17.090 --> 16:18.550
and the coffin for today's funeral

16:18.570 --> 16:20.300
are to your taste, aren't they?

16:20.500 --> 16:22.430
You know I'm a jinx.

16:22.450 --> 16:24.480
You'd better stay away from me.

16:24.500 --> 16:26.120
Or if something bad happens to you,

16:26.140 --> 16:27.720
that'll be terrible.

16:27.740 --> 16:29.850
But when that day comes,

16:30.090 --> 16:32.120
I'll prepare

16:32.140 --> 16:33.940
all those things you like

16:34.090 --> 16:35.860
for your funeral.

16:36.380 --> 16:37.740
My Lady!

16:43.570 --> 16:44.930
Miss!

16:46.360 --> 16:48.040
(Aman, Jiang Si's Maid)

16:48.050 --> 16:49.240
Aman.

16:49.260 --> 16:50.620
I'm back.

16:50.660 --> 16:52.020
I'm home.

16:53.700 --> 16:55.650
Come on. Let's go see my father.

16:59.570 --> 17:02.060
Jiang... Jiang Si...

17:02.260 --> 17:03.270
What are you looking at?

17:03.290 --> 17:05.030
Get rid of these!

17:05.050 --> 17:06.410
Now!

17:14.090 --> 17:15.020
Your father and brother

17:15.020 --> 17:16.400
are waiting by the Jinshui River.

17:16.420 --> 17:17.590
They refuse to leave.

17:17.610 --> 17:19.240
What are those bottles and jars

17:19.260 --> 17:20.420
you just grabbed for?

17:20.440 --> 17:21.540
Master went to look for you

17:21.540 --> 17:22.440
with tons of servants

17:22.460 --> 17:23.810
and hired all the skilled swimmers

17:23.810 --> 17:25.000
in Ling'an.

17:25.020 --> 17:26.780
He said he'd find you

17:26.780 --> 17:28.070
at all costs.

17:28.090 --> 17:29.020
But Ms. Xiao,

17:29.020 --> 17:30.260
who held the key to the vault,

17:30.260 --> 17:31.790
refused to pay a penny.

17:31.810 --> 17:33.240
Young Master Zhan had me

17:33.260 --> 17:35.330
come back to pawn some valuables

17:35.370 --> 17:37.500
to gather as much money as possible.

17:40.780 --> 17:42.110
Nothing here.

17:42.130 --> 17:43.160
Anything over there?

17:43.180 --> 17:44.110
Let me see.

17:44.130 --> 17:46.270
What about the east of the bridge?

17:46.290 --> 17:47.130
Nothing.

17:47.140 --> 17:48.310
Look carefully.

17:48.330 --> 17:50.050
Master, all of us have been looking

17:50.050 --> 17:51.400
- for a day and a night.
- There.

17:51.420 --> 17:53.720
There's no sign of her or her body.

17:53.740 --> 17:54.580
Shall we continue?

17:54.590 --> 17:55.750
Of course.

17:55.760 --> 17:57.530
(Jiang Ancheng, Earl, Si's Father)
Keep going

17:57.530 --> 17:59.300
(Jiang Zhan, Si's Brother)
until we find her!

17:59.300 --> 18:01.400
You only paid us 10 strings of coppers.

18:01.420 --> 18:03.540
That wasn't enough to pay us.

18:08.130 --> 18:09.070
Father,

18:09.090 --> 18:10.220
that was the only thing

18:10.240 --> 18:11.630
Mother left to you.

18:11.650 --> 18:12.610
It's all I have

18:12.610 --> 18:14.260
at the moment.

18:14.540 --> 18:16.670
I'll figure something out.

18:17.570 --> 18:18.930
Look,

18:19.650 --> 18:22.130
I have artworks and antiques at home.

18:22.130 --> 18:23.870
They're worth some money.

18:23.890 --> 18:25.680
Once we're done here,

18:25.700 --> 18:27.330
go back with me to get them.

18:27.330 --> 18:28.720
They're all yours.

18:28.740 --> 18:30.920
Please help me find my daughter.

18:30.940 --> 18:32.480
Please.

18:32.500 --> 18:34.110
I can only count on you!

18:34.130 --> 18:35.940
Fine. I'll do a good deed

18:35.940 --> 18:37.030
for you.

18:37.050 --> 18:38.240
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

18:38.260 --> 18:39.630
Thank you very much!

18:39.650 --> 18:41.260
Thank you all!

18:56.890 --> 18:58.250
Father!

18:59.700 --> 19:01.090
Brother!

19:02.570 --> 19:03.930
Father!

19:07.180 --> 19:08.540
Father,

19:08.870 --> 19:09.780
I hear as if

19:09.780 --> 19:11.810
Si is calling me.

19:13.370 --> 19:16.170
How I wish that was true!

19:18.700 --> 19:20.060
So do I.

19:20.940 --> 19:22.460
My head's spinning.

19:22.610 --> 19:25.060
I keep hearing Si calling me, too.

19:30.130 --> 19:31.490
Brother!

19:34.540 --> 19:35.940
Brother!

19:36.700 --> 19:38.060
Father!

19:38.780 --> 19:40.650
I see Si.

19:41.260 --> 19:42.570
I also see her

19:42.570 --> 19:44.830
in front of me all the time.

19:44.850 --> 19:47.350
Brother, I'm here!

19:47.370 --> 19:48.310
Sister!

19:48.330 --> 19:50.410
When your mother passed away,

19:50.850 --> 19:52.550
I kept seeing her, too.

19:52.570 --> 19:53.490
Sister!

19:53.510 --> 19:55.600
- Brother!
- I fear Si is unlikely to survive.

19:55.610 --> 19:58.460
- Sister!
- I failed to protect her.

19:58.460 --> 20:01.070
Father, it's her! It's Si!

20:01.090 --> 20:03.300
Master, it really is Miss Si!

20:07.500 --> 20:08.860
Father!

20:11.130 --> 20:12.490
Si!

20:13.130 --> 20:14.850
Is it you, Si?

20:15.330 --> 20:16.690
Father!

20:20.130 --> 20:21.960
- Si!
- Sister!

20:22.890 --> 20:24.940
Si!

20:26.850 --> 20:27.850
Si!

20:27.850 --> 20:29.350
I'm fine, Father.

20:29.370 --> 20:31.960
That's good. That's great.

20:31.980 --> 20:34.130
Didn't you drown? Are you alright?

20:34.130 --> 20:35.310
I'm good, Father.

20:35.330 --> 20:37.400
I thought I'd never see you again.

20:37.420 --> 20:39.150
Brother, promise me

20:39.150 --> 20:40.160
- I...
- to never

20:40.170 --> 20:41.610
go near the Jinshui River again.

20:41.610 --> 20:42.550
I won't. I won't.

20:42.570 --> 20:44.540
No, stay away from all rivers!

20:44.540 --> 20:46.110
Sure, sure, I will.

20:46.130 --> 20:48.030
Father, you have to promise me

20:48.050 --> 20:50.400
not to go back
to the Directorate of Astronomy.

20:50.420 --> 20:51.810
- Alright?
- Fine. Alright.

20:51.810 --> 20:53.130
Do not work there ever again.

20:53.130 --> 20:54.480
You have my word.

20:54.500 --> 20:55.540
From now on,

20:55.540 --> 20:57.720
I'll stay at home

20:57.740 --> 20:59.700
to be with you.

21:29.800 --> 21:36.080
(Yunmeng Inn)

21:36.090 --> 21:37.940
Chief, I've checked her out.

21:38.130 --> 21:39.080
Jiang Si ranks fourth

21:39.080 --> 21:40.120
in Earl Dongping's Mansion.

21:40.130 --> 21:41.520
Her father is Earl Dongping.

21:41.540 --> 21:43.430
Her mother's family was
the richest in Lingshui.

21:43.430 --> 21:44.400
She passed away

21:44.420 --> 21:45.890
when Jiang Si was born.

21:46.130 --> 21:48.000
Earl Dongping made a scene back then,

21:48.020 --> 21:48.930
which cost him his post

21:48.930 --> 21:49.940
and hereditary rank.

21:49.940 --> 21:51.400
He hasn't bounced back hence.

21:51.420 --> 21:52.480
That's why

21:52.500 --> 21:53.540
people call

21:53.540 --> 21:55.410
Jiang Si a...

21:57.460 --> 21:58.820
A what?

22:03.330 --> 22:04.590
Your tea.

22:04.610 --> 22:06.410
A jinx

22:06.500 --> 22:07.940
because of her mother's death

22:07.940 --> 22:09.940
and the fall of her clan.

22:10.650 --> 22:12.010
How absurd.

22:12.810 --> 22:14.520
People always blame misfortune

22:14.540 --> 22:16.410
on the weak and innocent.

22:16.570 --> 22:17.930
What else?

22:18.780 --> 22:19.940
Right now, Ms. Xiao

22:19.940 --> 22:21.920
of the Second Branch is taking charge.

22:21.940 --> 22:23.540
Seeing the clan falling,

22:23.540 --> 22:24.610
she meant to marry her off

22:24.610 --> 22:26.270
in haste to the third heir

22:26.290 --> 22:27.460
of Duke An's Mansion,

22:27.460 --> 22:28.960
Ji Chongyi,

22:28.980 --> 22:31.130
on the 8th of next month.

22:31.260 --> 22:32.620
What?

22:32.980 --> 22:34.310
Cancel it?

22:34.330 --> 22:36.520
Ji Chongyi cheated on me with someone else.

22:36.540 --> 22:37.790
He lied to me

22:37.810 --> 22:39.630
and made me almost drown to silence me.

22:39.650 --> 22:41.720
How could I marry such an animal?

22:41.740 --> 22:43.680
Si is right.

22:43.700 --> 22:46.270
But you're fine, aren't you?

22:46.290 --> 22:48.630
I know your father is mad

22:48.650 --> 22:50.980
about Young Master Ji's affair.

22:51.020 --> 22:53.160
So am I.

22:53.180 --> 22:56.310
But his family is rich and powerful.

22:56.330 --> 22:57.760
If you two get married,

22:57.780 --> 22:59.110
you'll be his wife.

22:59.130 --> 23:00.780
I won't marry him whatsoever.

23:01.850 --> 23:03.210
Si,

23:03.260 --> 23:04.520
I feel bad

23:04.540 --> 23:05.940
for your suffering.

23:06.050 --> 23:07.000
But do you know

23:07.020 --> 23:08.760
how much I did

23:08.780 --> 23:11.110
for this marriage?

23:11.130 --> 23:12.650
I went to great lengths

23:12.650 --> 23:14.480
to marry you up.

23:14.500 --> 23:16.030
All the girls in town

23:16.050 --> 23:17.270
are envious of you.

23:17.290 --> 23:18.830
If it's that good, why not

23:18.850 --> 23:20.370
marry Jiang Pei to him?

23:21.050 --> 23:22.410
That's right.

23:24.780 --> 23:27.170
You two siblings are ganging up on me

23:27.370 --> 23:29.440
as if I'm ill-willed against you.

23:29.460 --> 23:31.200
They didn't mean that.

23:31.220 --> 23:32.070
Brother,

23:32.090 --> 23:32.960
Si was meek

23:32.980 --> 23:35.650
before she almost drowned.

23:35.700 --> 23:36.540
But it seems

23:36.540 --> 23:38.310
that her only good quality

23:38.330 --> 23:39.420
has been washed away

23:39.420 --> 23:40.260
by the Jinshui River.

23:40.260 --> 23:41.400
Xiao,

23:41.420 --> 23:43.500
that was uncalled for!

23:43.500 --> 23:44.920
Be that as it may,

23:44.940 --> 23:47.030
what I said is true.

23:47.050 --> 23:48.180
Don't you want to

23:48.180 --> 23:49.400
marry her up?

23:49.420 --> 23:51.760
Wouldn't your wife want her
to marry a good man?

23:51.780 --> 23:53.240
Were she alive,

23:53.260 --> 23:55.590
she'd also marry her into Duke An's Mansion!

23:55.610 --> 23:57.130
Will you marry him or not?

23:57.130 --> 23:58.500
I will not.

23:59.940 --> 24:01.370
Were her mother alive,

24:01.370 --> 24:02.570
she'd think the same as me.

24:02.590 --> 24:03.570
We just want our children

24:03.570 --> 24:05.130
to lead a peaceful life.

24:08.500 --> 24:11.830
I'm being respectful to you, Brother.

24:11.850 --> 24:14.460
This marriage isn't up to you

24:14.500 --> 24:16.330
or me.

24:16.420 --> 24:19.090
When Mother comes back,

24:19.100 --> 24:21.290
let her decide!

24:21.500 --> 24:22.980
I dare you!

24:38.920 --> 24:43.640
(Haitang Chamber)

24:43.640 --> 24:46.300
(Peace)

24:46.320 --> 24:49.890
♪ Looking back, I recall our first encounter ♪

24:49.910 --> 24:53.430
♪ Feelings remain but things are complicated ♪

24:53.450 --> 24:56.700
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

24:57.040 --> 25:00.110
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

25:00.700 --> 25:04.210
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

25:04.230 --> 25:07.850
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

25:08.520 --> 25:11.200
(Haitang Chamber)

25:11.220 --> 25:14.830
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

25:14.850 --> 25:18.720
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

25:18.740 --> 25:22.280
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

25:22.300 --> 25:25.970
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

25:25.970 --> 25:29.280
♪ How can I move on ♪

25:29.280 --> 25:33.150
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

25:33.170 --> 25:36.560
♪ However long the road is ♪

25:36.580 --> 25:40.320
♪ If love is strong, one will have no fear ♪

25:40.320 --> 25:43.840
(Double Happiness)

25:58.370 --> 25:59.330
(My misfortune began)

25:59.330 --> 26:01.170
(when I married Ji Chongyi.)

26:01.610 --> 26:02.680
(There's no way)

26:02.700 --> 26:05.170
(will I repeat the same mistake.)

26:05.570 --> 26:07.020
(Whatever it takes, )

26:07.260 --> 26:08.850
(I will not marry him.)

26:11.420 --> 26:13.270
- Here.
- They're all your favorites.

26:13.290 --> 26:14.290
Don't eat without me!

26:14.290 --> 26:15.920
This is for you.

26:15.940 --> 26:17.560
Roast chicken from the Guangju Restaurant.

26:17.570 --> 26:19.680
It's your favorite, Si.

26:19.700 --> 26:20.720
My favorite?

26:20.740 --> 26:22.270
You like it more than her.

26:22.290 --> 26:23.890
It's our favorite.

26:25.700 --> 26:28.060
We're having this family dinner

26:28.290 --> 26:31.180
for Si's safe return.

26:31.180 --> 26:32.580
She'll be blessed for sure.

26:32.600 --> 26:33.960
Cheers!

26:36.330 --> 26:37.400
By the way,

26:37.420 --> 26:38.260
after you fell,

26:38.260 --> 26:39.910
who got you out of the water?

26:41.500 --> 26:43.090
A stranger who happened to pass by

26:43.090 --> 26:44.450
saved me.

26:45.330 --> 26:46.520
We should

26:46.540 --> 26:48.440
thank that person properly.

26:48.460 --> 26:49.630
Of course.

26:49.650 --> 26:51.100
No need, Father.

26:52.260 --> 26:54.110
I didn't ask his name.

26:54.130 --> 26:57.020
We won't be able to find him.

26:57.130 --> 27:00.130
How come you forgot to ask his name?

27:00.130 --> 27:01.480
He saved your life.

27:01.500 --> 27:02.680
- You...
- Father,

27:02.700 --> 27:04.940
she must've been too terrified to ask.

27:05.290 --> 27:06.650
Si,

27:07.130 --> 27:08.490
are you sure

27:08.700 --> 27:11.680
that you'll cancel your engagement?

27:11.700 --> 27:12.550
Father,

27:12.570 --> 27:14.870
Ji Chongyi cheated on me with another girl.

27:14.890 --> 27:16.610
He betrayed me.

27:16.650 --> 27:17.520
Besides,

27:17.540 --> 27:19.000
he showed no respect

27:19.020 --> 27:20.680
for our engagement at all.

27:20.700 --> 27:22.810
How could I lower myself to marry him

27:22.930 --> 27:24.520
and suffer a lifetime

27:24.540 --> 27:26.220
of misery?

27:26.330 --> 27:27.890
Don't marry him then.

27:28.290 --> 27:29.290
That rascal

27:29.290 --> 27:31.130
doesn't deserve you at all.

27:31.460 --> 27:32.480
Sister,

27:32.500 --> 27:34.090
whatever you do,

27:34.540 --> 27:35.960
I'll always have your back.

27:35.980 --> 27:38.050
I'll go to Duke An's Mansion tomorrow

27:38.050 --> 27:40.020
to return their betrothal gifts.

27:49.610 --> 27:52.240
Mrs. Li, let's hear it.

27:52.260 --> 27:53.120
Yes.

27:53.130 --> 27:55.920
A pair of filigree gold hairpins.

27:55.940 --> 27:57.920
300 bolts of silk.

27:57.940 --> 28:00.180
(Jiang Pei)
A phoenix-head ewer with pearl patterns

28:00.180 --> 28:01.900
(Si's 5th Cousin)
and beast-face patterns.

28:01.900 --> 28:02.460
An amphora

28:02.460 --> 28:04.570
with lotus patterns.

28:04.570 --> 28:06.870
5,000 taels of silver.

28:06.890 --> 28:09.410
200 taels of gold.

28:09.460 --> 28:10.820
Mother,

28:10.940 --> 28:12.940
look at these valuables.

28:13.090 --> 28:14.590
Were I the one to get married,

28:14.610 --> 28:15.960
all of them would be yours.

28:15.980 --> 28:16.850
You wouldn't need

28:16.850 --> 28:18.210
that nasty Jiang Si.

28:19.070 --> 28:19.930
Whoever it is,

28:19.950 --> 28:22.060
these are mine.

28:23.500 --> 28:24.720
Pei,

28:24.740 --> 28:27.350
don't be so cheap.

28:27.370 --> 28:28.920
To marry yourself up,

28:28.940 --> 28:31.240
you have to improve in all areas.

28:31.260 --> 28:32.370
No wonder Jiang Si

28:32.370 --> 28:34.120
outshines you.

28:37.180 --> 28:38.400
Yes.

28:38.420 --> 28:40.330
Lesson learned, Mother.

28:42.180 --> 28:43.400
Speaking of her,

28:43.420 --> 28:45.960
do you notice that she's changed

28:45.980 --> 28:47.550
since she almost drowned?

28:47.570 --> 28:48.810
She wouldn't dare talk back

28:48.810 --> 28:49.650
to you in the past.

28:49.670 --> 28:50.810
A naive girl like her

28:50.810 --> 28:52.480
can't do too much.

28:52.500 --> 28:53.860
Let her be.

28:54.020 --> 28:55.270
Mrs. Li,

28:55.290 --> 28:56.420
put them away

28:56.420 --> 28:58.000
in a secret place.

28:58.020 --> 28:59.700
Without the betrothal gifts,

28:59.700 --> 29:02.540
let's see if she can cancel the engagement.

29:08.810 --> 29:10.330
Father, Sister,

29:11.500 --> 29:12.890
I've thought it over.

29:13.460 --> 29:14.520
Tomorrow, the Tournament

29:14.540 --> 29:16.400
held once
every three years will begin.

29:16.420 --> 29:18.090
Tri-ministries will select officials there.

29:18.090 --> 29:19.520
If I win,

29:19.540 --> 29:21.270
I'll be the Commandant

29:21.290 --> 29:23.040
of the Capital Security Office.

29:23.460 --> 29:24.480
Then

29:24.500 --> 29:26.130
I'll move out with you two.

29:26.180 --> 29:28.100
We'll be out of Aunt Xiao's control.

29:32.290 --> 29:33.650
Good boy.

29:34.370 --> 29:35.810
You've grown up.

29:36.130 --> 29:37.700
But you can't go.

29:37.830 --> 29:38.700
Why?

29:38.700 --> 29:41.240
Don't you know how weak you are?

29:41.260 --> 29:42.500
The Tournament

29:42.500 --> 29:44.020
isn't a joke.

29:44.020 --> 29:46.020
- I...
- It's easy to join it but hard to

29:46.020 --> 29:47.330
- make it out alive.
- Si...

29:47.330 --> 29:48.400
I agree with Father.

29:48.420 --> 29:50.070
You cannot go, Brother.

29:50.090 --> 29:51.020
It sounds perilous.

29:51.020 --> 29:52.000
I...

29:52.020 --> 29:53.590
It's settled.

29:53.610 --> 29:55.610
Don't bring it up ever again.

29:58.130 --> 30:00.570
Father, why didn't you eat the chicken foot

30:00.570 --> 30:01.550
on your plate?

30:01.570 --> 30:03.080
Don't change the subject.

30:03.180 --> 30:04.370
Did you hear

30:04.370 --> 30:05.210
what I just said?

30:05.210 --> 30:06.890
The palm in the middle tastes the best.

30:06.890 --> 30:08.700
Listen, if you go,

30:08.700 --> 30:10.440
I'll break your legs when you get back.

30:10.460 --> 30:12.180
Foodies love to eat chicken feet.

30:12.180 --> 30:14.070
The more you nibble,
the better they taste.

30:14.090 --> 30:15.650
Why aren't you eating them?

30:15.810 --> 30:17.000
I've got a drumstick.

30:17.020 --> 30:19.220
So I can only eat the feet?

30:40.370 --> 30:43.090
(Father, Brother, )

30:43.500 --> 30:45.220
(it's so good)

30:46.050 --> 30:47.410
(to see you again.)

31:13.980 --> 31:15.080
(Thankfully, )

31:15.100 --> 31:16.820
(it's not too late.)

31:16.850 --> 31:19.260
(Father, Brother, )

31:19.650 --> 31:21.480
(this time, I'll protect you)

31:21.500 --> 31:23.370
(by all means.)

31:24.480 --> 31:29.060
(Zhou)

31:29.080 --> 31:33.520
(Grill Ground)

31:37.000 --> 31:42.000
(Fight)

31:42.020 --> 31:42.920
General Cui.

31:42.940 --> 31:44.300
Marquis.

31:44.650 --> 31:46.220
- Please.
- Please.

31:46.400 --> 31:50.140
(Cao Yong, Marquis Changxing)

31:50.160 --> 31:53.520
(Cui Xu, Bulwark-general of the State)

31:59.980 --> 32:01.940
Xingyu, step forward.

32:02.090 --> 32:04.170
Greet General Cui.

32:05.020 --> 32:08.000
(Cao Xingyu, Marquis Changxing's Heir)
Greetings, General.

32:08.330 --> 32:10.000
You'll have a lot to learn from him

32:10.020 --> 32:12.400
in the Capital Security Office.

32:12.420 --> 32:14.070
Thanks in advance, General.

32:14.090 --> 32:16.220
The Tournament this year

32:16.290 --> 32:19.000
sets no rules or regulations.

32:19.020 --> 32:20.760
If one falls from the platform,

32:20.780 --> 32:22.410
he'll lose.

32:22.540 --> 32:24.030
The ultimate winner

32:24.050 --> 32:25.610
will be the new Commandant

32:25.620 --> 32:27.410
of the Capital Security Office.

32:28.030 --> 32:29.650
Begin!

32:30.090 --> 32:31.680
(Father, Sister, )

32:31.700 --> 32:33.310
(wait and see.)

32:33.330 --> 32:35.370
(I'll win for sure.)

32:47.770 --> 32:48.610
Yes!

32:48.610 --> 32:49.970
Good!

32:50.090 --> 32:51.450
Fall now.

32:52.540 --> 32:54.220
Good job!

32:55.650 --> 32:57.330
Nice!

32:59.260 --> 33:01.870
Chief, Zheng is here as expected.

33:01.890 --> 33:03.590
I'll separate him from others.

33:04.920 --> 33:07.800
(Zheng Ming, Inspector-general)

33:08.540 --> 33:09.550
Excuse me.

33:09.570 --> 33:10.980
- Coming through.
- Excuse me.

33:10.980 --> 33:12.180
- Excuse me.
- Excuse me!

33:12.180 --> 33:13.540
Excuse me!

33:14.500 --> 33:15.860
Brother!

33:18.260 --> 33:19.100
Sister!

33:19.120 --> 33:20.070
Brother!

33:20.090 --> 33:21.450
Did you see that?

33:21.850 --> 33:23.220
A piece of cake.

33:27.290 --> 33:28.160
Ji,

33:28.180 --> 33:30.570
when did Zhan become so skilled?

33:32.500 --> 33:33.960
He paid those guys to lose.

33:33.980 --> 33:35.110
Don't worry, Miss Si.

33:35.130 --> 33:36.890
Next.

33:37.500 --> 33:38.500
Go, Brother!

33:38.520 --> 33:43.200
(Palace Security Office)

34:08.170 --> 34:09.630
Please excuse me.

34:09.650 --> 34:11.010
Sure.

34:23.730 --> 34:25.090
General Zheng.

34:25.340 --> 34:26.700
Sorry.

34:27.690 --> 34:30.150
Now, I should call you

34:30.170 --> 34:32.170
Inspector-general Zheng.

34:32.860 --> 34:34.220
How have you been?

34:34.500 --> 34:36.710
Long time no see, Mr. Yu.

34:36.730 --> 34:38.050
When did you arrive in Ling'an

34:38.050 --> 34:39.070
unannounced?

34:39.090 --> 34:40.580
I could've picked you up.

34:40.980 --> 34:42.340
Zheng Ming,

34:42.460 --> 34:44.110
what is it like to rise high

34:44.130 --> 34:46.540
at the cost of your comrades' lives,

34:46.730 --> 34:48.090
huh?

34:54.200 --> 34:56.200
(The South)

35:15.250 --> 35:16.900
Bring it on!

35:32.500 --> 35:34.610
Remember the Battle of the Longgu Pass?

35:35.130 --> 35:36.500
Hadn't you leaked intelligence

35:36.500 --> 35:37.860
to Nanwu,

35:37.880 --> 35:38.920
my deputy

35:38.920 --> 35:41.640
(Xue Qiang, Deputy of Chiyu Cavalry)
wouldn't have died.

35:45.650 --> 35:47.440
You must be joking, General Yu.

35:47.460 --> 35:49.540
I don't know what you're talking about.

36:08.170 --> 36:10.610
Go on!

36:13.470 --> 36:14.850
Good!

36:14.900 --> 36:16.650
Brother-in-law, you...

36:20.540 --> 36:21.900
Recognize this?

36:22.050 --> 36:23.110
It's

36:23.130 --> 36:25.110
the totem of Nanwu's Saintess.

36:25.130 --> 36:26.280
Nanwu's Saintess?

36:26.300 --> 36:27.720
Nanwu believes

36:27.740 --> 36:30.030
the Saintess appears, Nanwu thrives.

36:30.050 --> 36:31.540
Dazhou will be theirs.

36:31.730 --> 36:33.280
They set up the Nightingale Division

36:33.300 --> 36:35.320
to look for her.

36:35.340 --> 36:36.450
But over the past few years,

36:36.460 --> 36:38.230
they've found nothing.

36:38.250 --> 36:40.210
That's all I know.

36:40.340 --> 36:42.800
Please spare me, gentlemen.

36:42.820 --> 36:44.650
Spare you?

36:44.980 --> 36:46.940
So many soldiers died because of you.

36:46.940 --> 36:47.900
Did you spare them

36:47.900 --> 36:49.650
back then?

36:56.250 --> 36:57.610
Brother!

37:00.650 --> 37:02.060
Brother!

37:09.610 --> 37:11.020
Brother!

37:12.690 --> 37:13.880
No!

37:13.900 --> 37:14.960
Stop!

37:14.980 --> 37:16.340
Brother!

37:20.730 --> 37:22.090
Who was it?

37:28.770 --> 37:30.130
(Yu Qi?)

37:30.420 --> 37:31.940
(What's he doing here?)

37:35.130 --> 37:37.230
What a busybody.

37:37.250 --> 37:38.900
You're dead!

37:43.340 --> 37:44.590
How dare he break in!

37:44.610 --> 37:45.670
Guards, seize him!

37:45.690 --> 37:47.250
He already fell.

37:47.380 --> 37:49.090
Some win, some lose.

37:49.090 --> 37:51.500
Your son did his best.

38:08.980 --> 38:10.340
Are you alright?

38:14.980 --> 38:16.340
Hold on.

38:16.420 --> 38:17.860
I'm here to announce

38:18.340 --> 38:21.030
that the winner of the Tournament this year

38:21.050 --> 38:22.650
is this young man.

38:22.820 --> 38:24.790
Not only is he skilled

38:24.820 --> 38:26.480
but he's also noble.

38:26.500 --> 38:27.850
Talents like him

38:27.870 --> 38:29.860
are exactly what our state needs.

38:30.130 --> 38:31.800
May I know your name?

38:31.820 --> 38:32.840
Will you be the Commandant

38:32.860 --> 38:34.360
of the Capital Security Office

38:34.380 --> 38:36.340
to keep Ling'an safe?

38:41.840 --> 38:43.320
I'm Yu Qi.

38:43.340 --> 38:45.950
I helped him not to be an official,

38:45.980 --> 38:47.680
but I did disrupt

38:47.700 --> 38:49.080
the Tournament

38:49.100 --> 38:50.770
and the selection of the Commandant.

38:50.790 --> 38:53.040
I feel guilty about it.

38:55.640 --> 38:57.580
I'm willing to fill the vacancy

38:57.600 --> 38:59.780
until you find the best candidate.

38:59.800 --> 39:01.160
Very well!

39:02.720 --> 39:04.140
Yes! Great!

39:04.160 --> 39:05.860
(They've never met before.)

39:05.880 --> 39:07.760
(Why did Yu Qi help my brother?)

39:08.520 --> 39:10.360
(Seeing him in Ling'an)

39:10.640 --> 39:12.250
(and become the Commandant, )

39:12.880 --> 39:14.240
(I wonder)

39:14.560 --> 39:15.680
(what changed everything.)

39:15.680 --> 39:17.110
Good!

39:20.960 --> 39:22.440
Thank you, Yu Qi.

39:22.680 --> 39:24.380
I'll bow to you.

39:24.400 --> 39:25.580
No need.

39:25.600 --> 39:27.560
Don't tear your injuries.

39:28.000 --> 39:28.860
Mr. Yu,

39:28.880 --> 39:30.580
we're from Earl Dongping's Mansion.

39:30.600 --> 39:31.960
I'm Jiang Zhan.

39:32.200 --> 39:33.780
This is my younger sister,

39:33.800 --> 39:35.160
Jiang Si.

39:36.520 --> 39:37.960
Greetings, Miss Jiang.

39:38.720 --> 39:40.740
Where are you staying, Mr. Yu?

39:40.760 --> 39:42.830
I'll visit you and thank you later.

39:43.240 --> 39:45.680
I just arrived without an abode.

39:46.000 --> 39:48.520
Why don't you stay at our place?

39:48.800 --> 39:50.020
Brother,

39:50.040 --> 39:51.240
he must've come to Ling'an

39:51.240 --> 39:52.860
for important business.

39:52.880 --> 39:55.120
It's rude to make decisions for him.

39:55.640 --> 39:56.780
My apologies.

39:56.800 --> 39:58.300
It's fine, Miss Jiang.

39:58.320 --> 40:00.020
I'm new here.

40:00.040 --> 40:01.000
I don't know

40:01.000 --> 40:02.200
where I can buy a house.

40:02.200 --> 40:04.060
You've found the right person.

40:04.080 --> 40:05.700
The residence next to our mansion

40:05.720 --> 40:06.960
happens to be vacant...

40:06.960 --> 40:07.830
There are tons of them

40:07.830 --> 40:09.200
in town for rent or sale,

40:09.200 --> 40:11.660
such as those in the further western suburbs.

40:11.680 --> 40:12.740
If those ones are far,

40:12.760 --> 40:14.000
there are some on the south side

40:14.000 --> 40:15.340
close to shops.

40:15.360 --> 40:16.580
Thanks, Miss Jiang.

40:16.600 --> 40:18.500
Those she said are way too far.

40:18.520 --> 40:19.760
The one next to our mansion

40:19.760 --> 40:21.060
is available.

40:21.080 --> 40:22.060
If you live there, we can

40:22.060 --> 40:23.140
see each other often.

40:23.160 --> 40:24.520
Mr. Yu,

40:24.560 --> 40:26.020
where did you come from?

40:26.040 --> 40:28.080
The South, Yangui.

40:29.880 --> 40:32.700
Yangui lies at the southern border

40:32.720 --> 40:34.720
right next to Nanwu.

40:35.040 --> 40:36.420
It's really beautiful.

40:36.440 --> 40:39.320
Has any of you been there?

40:42.760 --> 40:47.240
(Yangui)

40:48.160 --> 40:50.080
Yangui is so beautiful.

40:50.200 --> 40:51.530
I've never seen

40:51.550 --> 40:53.680
such breathtaking views in my hometown.

40:55.680 --> 40:57.780
There's a lot more for you to discover.

40:59.040 --> 41:00.540
We'll explore all of them

41:00.560 --> 41:01.920
together.

41:06.930 --> 41:09.200
(Hadn't I ended up in the South, )

41:09.240 --> 41:11.200
(we wouldn't have met.)

41:11.600 --> 41:12.440
(He once said he had)

41:12.440 --> 41:14.120
(never returned to Ling'an.)

41:14.600 --> 41:16.560
(Was that a lie?)

41:19.960 --> 41:21.060
The two of us

41:21.080 --> 41:22.900
haven't even gone out of town once.

41:22.920 --> 41:25.240
(That matches Long Dan's findings.)

41:25.600 --> 41:28.160
(But if she never went to the South, )

41:28.200 --> 41:30.300
(how did she become Nanwu's Saintess?)

41:30.320 --> 41:31.500
The South is far away.

41:31.520 --> 41:32.980
Even if my sister went there,

41:33.000 --> 41:34.120
she'd cry and scream halfway,

41:34.120 --> 41:36.100
insisting on coming back.

41:36.120 --> 41:37.580
Brother, you're injured.

41:37.600 --> 41:38.560
Let's go home.

41:38.560 --> 41:39.900
You need to rest.

41:39.920 --> 41:41.320
- I...
- See you.

41:41.360 --> 41:42.200
Good day.

41:42.200 --> 41:44.420
See you, Mr. Yu.

41:44.440 --> 41:46.040
Do come and visit me.

41:46.720 --> 41:48.500
I think he and I are

41:48.520 --> 41:50.320
meant to be friends.

41:50.360 --> 41:51.340
Did you see

41:51.360 --> 41:53.220
that he was interested in everything I said?

41:53.240 --> 41:55.380
We're like-minded. That's rare.

41:55.400 --> 41:57.340
Sister, why did I feel

41:57.360 --> 41:59.460
you were eager to get rid of him?

41:59.480 --> 42:00.580
I meant to

42:00.600 --> 42:02.880
invite him to our place someday.

42:03.360 --> 42:05.100
Brother, we'd better

42:05.120 --> 42:07.200
not get too close to him.

42:07.360 --> 42:08.720
Why?

42:08.760 --> 42:11.460
Hadn't it been for him just now,

42:11.480 --> 42:12.320
the two of us

42:12.320 --> 42:13.460
would've died.

42:13.480 --> 42:14.580
I know,

42:14.600 --> 42:16.700
but we barely know him.

42:16.720 --> 42:18.360
It's best to be cautious.

42:19.120 --> 42:20.480
Pack up everything.

42:21.560 --> 42:23.160
Are we going back to Yangui?

42:23.600 --> 42:24.820
We're staying here.

42:24.840 --> 42:26.100
Chief,

42:26.120 --> 42:27.200
it's quite risky to return

42:27.200 --> 42:28.850
without permission.

42:28.870 --> 42:30.520
All those Chiyu Cavalrymen

42:30.520 --> 42:31.940
are still waiting for us.

42:31.960 --> 42:34.080
I think we should go back.

42:36.720 --> 42:38.080
Chief!

42:41.520 --> 42:43.160
I've got new leads

42:43.720 --> 42:46.000
and seen the Saintess's Totem.

42:46.360 --> 42:48.720
I can't leave now.

42:49.760 --> 42:54.160
(The End of Episode 1)

42:54.570 --> 42:56.300
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.300 --> 43:01.240
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.610 --> 43:03.990
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.990 --> 43:08.220
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.930 --> 43:11.330
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.350 --> 43:15.010
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.030 --> 43:18.450
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.600 --> 43:24.120
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.940 --> 43:28.620
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.620 --> 43:32.700
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.940 --> 43:34.680
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.700 --> 43:39.400
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.400 --> 43:42.970
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.990 --> 43:47.220
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.240 --> 43:49.020
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.020 --> 43:53.560
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.580 --> 43:58.380
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.610 --> 44:05.140
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.160 --> 44:08.780
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.800 --> 44:12.230
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.250 --> 44:16.870
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.870 --> 44:20.560
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.580 --> 44:24.670
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.780 --> 44:26.600
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.600 --> 44:31.150
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.170 --> 44:34.870
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.890 --> 44:39.050
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.230 --> 44:40.990
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.990 --> 44:45.510
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.510 --> 44:49.150
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.170 --> 44:54.840
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.530 --> 44:58.460
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.460 --> 45:05.960
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
